1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,520
Propane, methoxymethane and ethanol have almost the same molar mass.

2
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:13,111
Yet propane boils at minus forty two, the ether at minus twenty four, and ethanol at plus seventy eight degrees.

3
00:00:13,111 --> 00:00:15,338
The reason is hydrogen bonding.

4
00:00:15,338 --> 00:00:24,127
The O H hydrogen of one ethanol molecule is attracted to the oxygen of the next, and boiling means breaking that whole network.

